<p>You electronically signed a logbook entry.</p>
<p>Aircraft: <strong><%= @entry.aircraft.tail_number %></strong><br>
Entry: <%= @entry.date %>, <%= LogbookEntry::LOG_TYPES[@entry.log_type] %> log<br>
Certified by: <%= @signature.signer_name %>, <%= @signature.certificate_label %> <%= @signature.certificate_number %><br>
Signed: <%= @signature.signed_at.utc.strftime("%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S UTC") %></p>
<p>Statement: <em><%= @signature.statement %></em></p>
<p style="color:#64748b;font-size:12px">Fingerprint: <%= @signature.content_digest %></p>
<p>If you didn't sign this, tell the aircraft's owner right away.</p>
